{"version":3,"term":{"cols":80,"rows":24},"timestamp":1788061021,"idle_time_limit":4.0,"command":"AGENT=agy ./hack/demo-connect.sh","title":"ocm-mcp-server - a fleet operator's day with agy","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.039, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 1. install the MCP server from PyPI\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ rm -rf '/Users/sandeepbazar/01.Projects/SandeepBazar/ocm-mcp-server/.demo-connect' && mkdir -p '/Users/sandeepbazar/01.Projects/SandeepBazar/ocm-mcp-server/.demo-connect' && cd '/Users/sandeepbazar/01.Projects/SandeepBazar/ocm-mcp-server/.demo-connect'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.761, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ python3 -m venv ocm && source ocm/bin/activate\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.493, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ pip install -q ocm-mcp-server && which ocm-mcp-server\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.362, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m[\u001b[0m\u001b[34;49mnotice\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39;49m]\u001b[0m\u001b[39;49m A new release of pip is available: \u001b[0m\u001b[31;49m25.2\u001b[0m\u001b[39;49m -> \u001b[0m\u001b[32;49m26.2.1\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m[\u001b[0m\u001b[34;49mnotice\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39;49m]\u001b[0m\u001b[39;49m To update, run: \u001b[0m\u001b[32;49mpip install --upgrade pip\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.389, "o", "/Users/sandeepbazar/01.Projects/SandeepBazar/ocm-mcp-server/.demo-connect/ocm/bin/ocm-mcp-server\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 2. point it at the fleet: hub context, read-only spoke contexts, a state dir\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ export OCM_MCP_HUB_CONTEXT=kind-hub\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ export OCM_MCP_SPOKE_CONTEXTS=cluster1=kind-cluster1,cluster2=kind-cluster2,cluster3=kind-cluster3\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ export OCM_MCP_HOME=$PWD/state\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 3. add it to agy - guardrailed tools in, kubeconfig stays out\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ agy mcp remove ocm >/dev/null 2>&1 || true\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.048, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ agy mcp add -e OCM_MCP_HUB_CONTEXT=$OCM_MCP_HUB_CONTEXT -e OCM_MCP_SPOKE_CONTEXTS=$OCM_MCP_SPOKE_CONTEXTS -e OCM_MCP_HOME=$OCM_MCP_HOME ocm /Users/sandeepbazar/01.Projects/SandeepBazar/ocm-mcp-server/.demo-connect/ocm/bin/ocm-mcp-server\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.045, "o", "Added MCP server \"ocm\" (stdio)\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ agy mcp list | grep ocm\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.042, "o", "ocm                                 stdio  enabled  /Users/sandeepbazar/01.Projects/SandeepBazar/ocm-mcp-server/.demo-connect/ocm/bin/ocm-mcp-server\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 3b. fixtures: a cluster-set binding, a Placement, and the target namespace\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "  placement demo-all + namespace shop ready\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 4. KNOW the fleet - inventory, versions, capacity, add-ons. one question\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ agy -p \"Give me a crisp fleet overview: every managed cluster with availability, Kubernetes version and ...\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[28.127, "o", "### Fleet Overview\r\n\r\n| Cluster | Availability | J"]
[0.201, "o", "oined | K8s Version | Capacity (CPU / Memory) | Add-on Health |\r\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\r\n| **cluster1** | `True` (Available) | `True` | `v1.30.4` | 4 CPU / ~7.72 GiB (`8099496Ki`) | None installed "]
[0.201, "o", "|\r\n| **cluster2** | `True` (Available) | `True` | `v1.30.4` | 4 CPU / ~7.72 GiB (`8099496Ki`) | None installed |\r\n| **cluster3** | `True` (Available) | `True` | `v1.30.4` | 4 CPU / ~7.72 GiB (`8099496Ki`) | None installed |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n"]
[0.201, "o", "### Key Notes\r\n* **Managed Clusters**: 3/3 clusters are registered, joined, and available.\r\n* **Platform Add-ons**: No `ClusterManagementAddOn` or `ManagedClusterAddOn` instances are configured across the fleet.\r\n* **Workload Health**: `cluster1` and `cluster3` workloads are healthy; `cluster2` has degraded pods in namespace `shop` (`storefront` failing with `CreateContainerConfigError`).\r\n"]
[0.006, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 5. PLACEMENT - where will new workloads land, and why?\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ agy -p \"Explain the placement named demo-all in namespace default: which clusters does it currently sele...\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.054, "o", "The Placement **`demo-all`** in namespace `default` currently selects **`cluster1`**, **`cluster2`**, and **"]
[0.200, "o", "`cluster3`**.\r\n\r\n**Why:**\r\n- Its spec targets the **`global`** cluster set (`spec.clusterSets: [\"global\"]`) without any limiting count or predicate filters.\r\n- The `global` `ManagedClusterSet` uses an empty label selector (`{}`), which encompasses all managed clusters in the fleet (`cluster1`, `cluster2`, `cluster3`).\r\n"]
[0.008, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 6. ship a new service the LAZY way - the guardrails must refuse\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ agy -p \"Ship a new storefront service fast: propose deploying image nginx:latest to namespace shop on cl...\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[32.050, "o", "The proposal to deploy `nginx:latest` running privileged to the `shop` namespace on `cluster2` was **refused and rejected** by the hub's static guardrails during `propose_manifestwork`.\r\n\r\n### Exact Refusal Reason\r\n\r\n```text\r\nREJECTED by static guardrails:\r\n- [manifest "]
[0.200, "o", "0] automountServiceAccountToken must be explicitly false - an auto-mounted API token is a credential the workload does not need.\r\n- [manifest 0] container 'storefront': privileged=true is not allowed.\r\n- [manifest 0] container 'storefront': allowPrivilegeEscalation "]
[0.201, "o", "must be explicitly false.\r\n- [manifest 0] container 'storefront': runAsNonRoot must be true (pod or container).\r\n- [manifest 0] container 'storefront': capabilities.drop must include ALL.\r\n- [manifest 0] container 'storefront': seccompProfile.type must be"]
[0.200, "o", " one of Localhost, RuntimeDefault (pod or container).\r\n- [manifest 0] container 'storefront': image 'nginx:latest' must be pinned (no :latest, no floating tags).\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Summary of Violations\r\n1. **Privilege & Security Context**:\r\n   - `privileged: true` is explicitly forbidden.\r\n   - `allowPrivilegeEscalation` must be set to `false`.\r\n   - `runAsNonRoot` must be set to `true`.\r\n   - `capabilities.drop` must contain `[\"ALL\"]`.\r\n   - `seccompProfile.type` must be set to `RuntimeDefault` or `Localhost`.\r\n2. **Service Account Token**:\r\n   - `automountServiceAccountToken` must be explicitly set to `false`.\r\n3. **Image Immutability**:\r\n   - The tag `:latest` is floating and disallowed; an immutable/pinned image digest or specific non-floating tag is required.\r\n"]
[0.006, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 7. ship it RIGHT - the agent can only PROPOSE, never apply on its own\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ agy -p \"Propose - do not apply - a ManifestWork named storefront on cluster2: a Deployment in namespace ...\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[115.744, "o", "The ManifestWork **`storefront`** has been proposed on **`cluster2`** (not applied) and passed all static guardrails and Kyverno dry-run validation.\r\n\r\n### Proposal Details\r\n- **Proposal ID:** `c5011733c1c64399850ebb90693a1045`\r\n- **Cluster:** `cluster2`\r\n- **Target Workload:** `D"]
[0.201, "o", "eployment/storefront` (2 replicas of `nginx:1.27.4`) in namespace `shop`\r\n- **Security Posture:** Restricted Pod Security Profile (`runAsNonRoot: true`, `allowPrivilegeEscalation: false`, `capabilities.drop: [\"ALL\"]`, `seccompProfile: RuntimeDefault`, `automountSer"]
[0.200, "o", "viceAccountToken: false`)\r\n- **Status:** `pending_approval`\r\n\r\nTo approve and mint an approval token for this proposal, run:\r\n```bash\r\nocm-mcp approve c5011733c1"]
[0.200, "o", "c64399850ebb90693a1045\r\n```\r\n"]
[0.008, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 8. a human reviews and signs in the terminal (Ed25519) - the only way through\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ ocm-mcp pending\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.519, "o", "  c5011733c1c64399850ebb90693a1045  cluster=cluster2  kind=manifestwork  name=storefront\r\n          Deploy storefront Deployment in namespace shop with 2 replicas of nginx:1.27.4, non-root security context, privilege escalation disabled, and all capabilities dropped.\r\n"]
[0.074, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ ocm-mcp show c5011733c1c64399850ebb90693a1045\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.064, "o", "id:       c5011733c1c64399850ebb90693a1045\r\ncluster:  cluster2\r\nname:     storefront\r\nstatus:   pending\r\nsummary:  Deploy storefront Deployment in namespace shop with 2 replicas of nginx:1.27.4, non-root security context, privilege escalation disabled, and all capabilities dropped.\r\nmanifests:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "[\r\n  {\r\n    \"apiVersion\": \"apps/v1\",\r\n    \"kind\": \"Deployment\",\r\n    \"metadata\": {\r\n      \"labels\": {\r\n        \"app\": \"storefront\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"name\": \"storefront\",\r\n      \"namespace\": \"shop\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"spec\": {\r\n      \"replicas\": 2,\r\n      \"selector\": {\r\n        \"matchLabels\": {\r\n          \"app\": \"storefront\"\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      \"template\": {\r\n        \"metadata\": {\r\n          \"labels\": {\r\n            \"app\": \"storefront\"\r\n          }\r\n        },\r\n        \"spec\": {\r\n          \"automountServiceAccountToken\": false,\r\n          \"containers\": [\r\n            {\r\n              \"image\": \"nginx:1.27.4\",\r\n              \"name\": \"nginx\",\r\n              \"ports\": [\r\n                {\r\n                  \"containerPort\": 8080,\r\n                  \"name\": \"http\"\r\n                }\r\n              ],\r\n              \"securityContext\": {\r\n                \"allowPrivilegeEscalation\": false,\r\n                \"capabilities\": {\r\n                  \"drop\": [\r\n                    \"ALL\"\r\n                  ]\r\n                "]
[0.000, "o", "},\r\n                \"runAsNonRoot\": true,\r\n                \"seccompProfile\": {\r\n                  \"type\": \"RuntimeDefault\"\r\n                }\r\n              }\r\n            }\r\n          ],\r\n          \"securityContext\": {\r\n            \"runAsNonRoot\": true,\r\n            \"seccompProfile\": {\r\n              \"type\": \"RuntimeDefault\"\r\n            }\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n]"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.006, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ ocm-mcp approve c5011733c1c64399850ebb90693a1045 --yes\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.067, "o", "Approval token for this apply (give this to the agent):\r\._AjVJcC9STbUM-K6EjmQr3ql2OkM-4hyHq6GFcL4w1mBXujG_lJF1Bx4oe36Hw_gE4_vADlJFxgUCg73CnDJCQ\r\n"]
[0.007, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 9. only WITH the token can agy apply - then it verifies the rollout\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ agy -p \"Apply proposal c5011733c1c64399850ebb90693a1045 on cluster2 using this approval token: eyJhcHByb...\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[41.202, "o", "Proposal **`c5011733c1c64399850ebb90693a1045`** has "]
[0.200, "o", "been applied to **`cluster2`**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### **1. Application Status**\r\n* **ManifestWork:** `storefront`\r\n* **Cluster:** `cluster2`\r\n* **Status:** `applied`\r\n* **OCM Conditions:** `Applied: True"]
[0.202, "o", "`, `Available: True`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### **2. Rollout Verification & Current State**\r\n\r\nWhile the ManifestWork was applied successfully by the hub, the workload on the spoke cluster is currently **degraded** and **0/2 replicas are running**:\r\n\r\n#### **"]
[0.200, "o", "Deployment Status**\r\n* **Namespace:** `shop`\r\n* **Deployment:** `storefront`\r\n* **Ready Replicas:** `0/2`\r\n\r\n#### **Pod Status**\r\n* `storefront-67444754f5-4ttc6` — **Pending** (`CreateContainerConfigError`)\r\n* `storefront-67444754f5-"]
[0.200, "o", "8f28h` — **Pending** (`CreateContainerConfigError`)\r\n\r\n#### **Root Cause from Cluster Events**\r\n```\r\nError: container has runAsNonRoot and image will run as root (container: nginx)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe standard `nginx:1.27.4` container image defaults to running as root (UID 0), but the deployment configuration enforces `runAsNonRoot: true` without specifying an explicit unprivileged UID or using an unprivileged base image (e.g. `nginxinc/nginx-unprivileged`). As a result, the containers fail to start.\r\n"]
[0.006, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 10. the day, on the record - an operations log straight from the audit trail\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;90m$ agy -p \"From the audit trail, summarize this session as an operations log: the fleet review, the placeme...\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.846, "o", "### Operations Log Summary\r\n\r\n* **Fleet Review**\r\n  * Enumerated managed clusters (`list_clusters`) and evaluated fleet health (`get_fl"]
[0.200, "o", "eet_health`).\r\n  * Inspected cluster management add-on inventory and health across the fleet and target clusters (`get_addon_health`, `list_cluster_management_addons`, `list_addons_for_cluster`).\r\n\r\n* **Placement Check**\r\n  * Evalua"]
[0.201, "o", "ted placement resource `demo-all` and queried placement decisions in namespace `default` (`get_placement_decision`, `get_resource`).\r\n  * Verified cluster set memberships and bindings for the `global` ManagedClusterSet (`list_cluster_sets`, "]
[0.200, "o", "`get_resource`).\r\n\r\n* **Refused Shortcut**\r\n  * Attempted deployment shortcut proposing an unpinned image (`nginx:latest`) with `securityContext.privileged: true` on `cluster2` (`propose_manifestwork`).\r\n  * Blocked and rejected by "]
[0.201, "o", "pre-flight admission / security policy controls.\r\n\r\n* **Approved Change**\r\n  * Created compliant ManifestWork proposal (`propose_manifestwork` id: `c5011733c1c64399850ebb90693a1045`) for `storefront` in namespace `shop` with 2 replicas of `ngi"]
[0.201, "o", "nx:1.27.4`, `runAsNonRoot: true`, `allowPrivilegeEscalation: false`, dropped capabilities (`ALL`), and `RuntimeDefault` seccomp profile.\r\n  * Successfully applied the change using the generated approval token (`apply_manifestwork`).\r\n\r\n* **Verification**\r\n  * Verified applied ManifestWork status on `cluster2` (`get_manifestwork`).\r\n  * Checked cluster health (`get_cluster_health`), examined namespace events (`query_events`), and audited pod logs (`get_pod_logs`) for the deployed storefront pod in namespace `shop`.\r\n"]
[0.006, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# done - fleet left running; tear down with ./hack/teardown.sh\u001b[0m\r\n"]
